 "description": "Who bundled a Solana pump.fun launch: every block-0 wallet labelled sniper bot / bundle / dev-linked, supply bought and still held, holders who got tokens by transfer, serial-dev check, top-10 concentration, RugCheck \u2014 plus a back-tested skip/pass verdict. The rug guard MAD snipers use before every buy. Skip rules were tested on 2,221 real caller calls (held-out: stop-outs 10%\u21925%, rugs 16%\u219211%): creator launched another coin in the prior 24 h; top-10 wallets >35%; block-0 wallets that also bundled this creator's earlier launches; block-0 buys >20% of supply. Extra flags: RugCheck danger risks, insider wallets >15%, and >10% held by wallets that never bought on the curve (tokens moved in by transfer, the layered-bundle pattern of launch tools like Proxima). \"ok:true\" means no red flags were found, not that the coin is safe. When to use: To see WHO bundled a launch and get the skip/pass rug guard MAD snipers use; for a scored launch verdict use launch_scan. Price: $0.003 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
